<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Bienvenue chez Uniflow</title>
    <style>
        body,
        html {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f6f9fc;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #10b981);
            padding: 40px 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }

        .logo {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin: 0 auto 16px;
            padding: 12px;
            display: inline-block;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: left;
            color: #334155;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .text {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            color: #475569;
        }

        .credentials-box {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }

        .credential-item {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .credential-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #64748b;
            display: block;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .credential-value {
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #2563eb;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .btn-wrapper {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 32px 0;
        }

        .btn {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #10b981);
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            display: inline-block;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .footer {
            padding: 24px;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">
                <img src="cid:uniflow_logo" alt="Uniflow" style="height: 64px; width: auto; display: block;">
            </div>
            <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800;">Uniflow</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h2 class="title">Bienvenue, {{name}} !</h2>
            <p class="text">Bonjour,</p>
            <p class="text">Votre compte Uniflow en tant que <strong>{{role}}</strong> a été créé avec succès par l'administrateur. Voici vos informations de connexion :</p>
            
            <div class="credentials-box">
                <div class="credential-item">
                    <span class="credential-label">Email</span>
                    <span class="credential-value">{{email}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="credential-item">
                    <span class="credential-label">Mot de passe provisoire</span>
                    <span class="credential-value">{{password}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="btn-wrapper">
                <a href="{{loginLink}}" class="btn">Se connecter à Uniflow</a>
            </div>

            <p class="text" style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 24px;">
                Par mesure de sécurité, nous vous recommandons de changer votre mot de passe dès votre première connexion.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Uniflow. Tous droits réservés.</p>
            <p>Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement pour confirmer la création de votre compte.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
